 require MCard entry and are limited to specified medical and graduate student populations.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umich-aael-floor-2-stacks-spaces","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Art, Architecture, and Engineering Library Floor 2 Stacks Spaces","title":"AAEL Floor 2 Stacks Spaces","subtitle":"Art, Architecture, and Engineering Library, Floor 2","notes":"Head through the northeast double doors from the lobby, then choose window counters, individual desks, large tables, or corner armchairs.","short_summary":"Quiet second-floor stacks seating inside the Duderstadt Center with several work surfaces.","evidence_claim":"The quiet stacks area includes bar-height window counters, individual desks, large tables, corner armchairs, natural light, and wheelchair access.","source_url":"https://www.lib.umich.edu/visit-and-study/study-spaces/quiet-study-spaces/art-architecture-and-engineering-library-floor-2-stacks-spaces","source_title":"Art, Architecture, and Engineering Library Floor 2 Stacks Spaces | University of Michigan Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Enter the Duderstadt Center’s floor 2, then pass from lobby spaces through the northeast double doors.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umich-fine-arts-library-floor-2","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Fine Arts Library Floor 2","title":"Fine Arts Library Floor 2","subtitle":"Fine Arts Library, Tappan Hall, Floor 2","notes":"Enter through Tappan Hall’s second-floor doors and choose a large wood table or a deeper-in-the-stacks table; keep food wrapped and drinks covered.","short_summary":"A quiet, high-ceilinged, book-lined room with large wood tables and window light.","evidence_claim":"The second floor has quiet study space with large wooden tables, book stacks, natural light, and restrictions to covered drinks and wrapped food.","source_url":"https://www.lib.umich.edu/visit-and-study/study-spaces/quiet-study-spaces/fine-arts-library-floor-2","source_title":"Fine Arts Library Floor 2 | University of Michigan Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Enter via Tappan Hall’s second floor; only covered drinks and wrapped food are permitted.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umich-music-library-floors-3-and-4","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Music Library Floors 3 and 4","title":"Music Library Floors 3 and 4","subtitle":"Music Library, Floors 3 and 4","notes":"Use floor 3 for window tables or armchair clusters, and plan for stairs to floor 4 unless staff can assist with the elevator.","short_summary":"Quiet, airy North Campus study floors with tables, armchairs, and wooded views.","evidence_claim":"All Music Library study space is on floors 3 and 4, with natural light, tables, armchairs, and wheelchair accessibility.","source_url":"https://www.lib.umich.edu/visit-and-study/study-spaces/quiet-study-spaces/music-library-floors-3-and-4","source_title":"Music Library Floors 3 and 4 | University of Michigan Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Floor-4 primary access is by stairs; request staff help at the Information Services Desk for elevator use. Covered drinks and small snacks only.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
